l combat.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">6 castles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">10 chapters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Custom chapters. Create your own custom chapter according to the following:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each completed castle, or castle part will be unlocked for custom chapters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Select the game mode you want to play in the custom chapter:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rescue the princess.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find the treasure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Escape.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Extra gold you find in the story mode will help you unlock heroes to join you to custom chapters.</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Demo</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Demo available!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play chapter 1 out of the 10 chapters of the game.</p>","developers":["David Amado"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348120/header.jpg?t=1742301479","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257091955,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257091955/movie480.mp4?t=1737745929","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257091955/movie_max.mp4?t=1737745929"},"name":"Guards vs Goats Demo Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257091955/354af70cfa0f01f8fd3992819bac3e1c79b560af/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1737745929","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257091955/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1737745929","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257091955/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1737745929"}},{"highlight":true,"id":257107319,"m